    "is_free": true,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make Your Country Dominate Again is a minimalist PvP Super MMO idle strategy game about the collective conquest of territory and the absorption of real-world countries.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Why &quot;Super MMO&quot;? Because players from all over the world \u2014 in unlimited numbers \u2014 exist on one single, monolithic map at the same time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The player, an immaterial entity, uses their share of influence to help some nations consume others. Player actions are expressed through Arrows \u2014 to invade neighboring countries \u2014 and Flags \u2014 to defend their own. The entire world becomes a superposition of every player's input across the planet.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The main goal is to help your country conquer the entire world. That\u2019s the victory condition.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3608680/extras/4b7e9a06e5a8b58efe3a1b024324dd4b.avif?t=1747061514\" width=800 height=482 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tactically, you focus on generating Energy through a system of Devices. The energy you produce represents your influence as a player in the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You monitor the charge level of your main Dynamo Machine \u2014 the core of your energy production \u2014 and strategically activate temporary boosters throughout the day.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3608680/extras/1321c8b8ce614f5d6484fd5345b51df1.avif?t=1747061514\" width=800 height=198 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Dynamo Machine and other Devices can be upgraded to match your playstyle:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stay active longer in offline mode</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Generate more Energy during active play</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Provide temporary boosters for sudden attacks</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3608680/extras/42b3d5ad5f4736f2b7fb21d7c2495bde.avif?t=1747061514\" width=800 height=210 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can always reset the device upgrade tree and experiment with different configurations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3608680/extras/70301540b7c1851fd2d02d3385d72f9b.avif?t=1747061514\" width=434 height=738 /></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make Your Country Dominate Again is a minimalist PvP Super MMO idle strategy game about the collective conquest of territory and the absorption of real-world countries.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Why &quot;Super MMO&quot;? Because players from all over the world \u2014 in unlimited numbers \u2014 exist on one single, monolithic map at the same time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The player, an immaterial entity, uses their share of influence to help some nations consume others. Player actions are expressed through Arrows \u2014 to invade neighboring countries \u2014 and Flags \u2014 to defend their own. The entire world becomes a superposition of every player's input across the planet.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The main goal is to help your country conquer the entire world. That\u2019s the victory condition.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3608680/extras/4b7e9a06e5a8b58efe3a1b024324dd4b.avif?t=1747061514\" width=800 height=482 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tactically, you focus on generating Energy through a system of Devices. The energy you produce represents your influence as a player in the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You monitor the charge level of your main Dynamo Machine \u2014 the core of your energy production \u2014 and strategically activate temporary boosters throughout the day.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3608680/extras/1321c8b8ce614f5d6484fd5345b51df1.avif?t=1747061514\" width=800 height=198 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Dynamo Machine and other Devices can be upgraded to match your playstyle:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stay active longer in offline mode</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Generate more Energy during active play</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Provide temporary boosters for sudden attacks</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3608680/extras/42b3d5ad5f4736f2b7fb21d7c2495bde.avif?t=1747061514\" width=800 height=210 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can always reset the device upgrade tree and experiment with different configurations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3608680/extras/70301540b7c1851fd2d02d3385d72f9b.avif?t=1747061514\" width=434 height=738 /></span></p>",
    "short_description": "Welcome to a global multiplayer meat grinder. This is a strategy game where you don\u2019t just win \u2014 you collectively erase countries from a single, shared world map. Only one nation is allowed to survive!",
